# Four-Agent Model Policy (P1 Candidate)

**Status:** NOT_DEFAULT_NOT_PROVEN
**Version:** P1-candidate

## Agent Count
Maximum 4 agents per implementation phase:
1. Orchestrator
2. Product Builder
3. Test/Integration/Docs Builder
4. Reviewer-Verifier (READONLY)

## Trigger for >4
Additional agents require:
1. Project >20 modules AND
2. AGENT-9-P1 re-test PASS OR new benchmark evidence AND
3. User explicit approval

## Default
4-agent model is the P1 candidate default. Multi-agent implementation is NOT proven.
